      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey, im doing some research for my sociology dissertation on the \"myth of meritocracy.\" i need to put together a section on the critiques of traditional metrics. can you summarize the most compelling arguments for why IQ and standardized testing might not be considered valid measures of \"merit\" in a social context?",
